# CodeGraph data files — local to each machine, not for committing.
# Ignore everything in .codegraph/ except this file itself, so transient
# files (the database, daemon.pid, sockets, logs) never show up in git.
#
# Source-tree exclusions (controlling what codegraph INDEXES) live in the
# project root .gitignore, not here. The following paths are excluded from
# the codegraph index via the root .gitignore:
#   .proposed_changes/   — archive snapshots (March–April 2026)
#   archive/             — legacy code and old reports
#   scratch/             — ad-hoc test files
#   .codegraph/          — this directory (self)
#   .opencode/ .cursor/ .hypothesis/ .sixth/ .kilo/ .idx/ .temp/ — tool state
*
!.gitignore
